  "2026-08-18T06:30:42.678Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: searched all-status PM via semantic queries for core flag invocation boolean arity, exact --defaults/--require-assertions takes_value symptoms, and direct tracker grep. Closed pm-11phn1 delivered semantic invocation metadata; closed pm-853a fixed extension-only arity; closed pm-m7bb7r fixed assurance --apply. None owns the current generic core-command derivation regression, so this is a new issue linked as discovered_from pm-11phn1 rather than reopening or duplicating those completed outcomes."
